  "url_planning_app": "https://rspandlp.merton.gov.uk//planning/index.html?fa=getApplication&id=258315",
  "status": "Refused",
  "reference_no_of_permission_being_relied_on": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The outbuilding, by reason of its combined siting and excessive scale results in an unsympathetic and incongruous form of development that fails to reflect the form and proportion of a typical outbuilding for ancillary use associated with the main dwellinghouse in the locality to the detriment of the visual amenity of the surrounding.  The scheme is contrary to policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021) policies D12.3 and D12.4 of Merton's Local Plan (2024)",
    "Reason : 2 - In the absence of a Flood Risk Assessment, it has not been demonstrated the scheme safeguards the risk of flooding in the locality. The proposal is contrary to, in particular, London Plan (2021) policy SI 13 and Merton Local Plan (2024) policy F15.7",
    "Reason : 3 - In the absence of a fire safety strategy, the applicant has failed to demonstrate that the development would provide the highest standard of fire safety, thereby failing to comply with policy D12 of the London Plan 2021",
    "Reason : 4 - The applicant has failed to demonstrate, with a lack of information being provided, that the development would comply with adopted planning policies and that the development would not have a harmful impact on the biodiversity value of the site in conflict with Policy G7 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy O15.2 of Merton's Local Plan (2024)",
    "Reason : 5 - INFORMATIVE\r\nNote to Applicant\r\nIn accordance with paragraph 38 of the NPPF, The London Borough of Merton  (LBM) takes a positive and proactive approach to development proposals focused on solutions. LBM works with applicants/agents in a positive and proactive manner by:\r\n\"\tOffering a pre-application advice \r\n\"\tWhere possible, suggesting solutions to secure a successful outcome.\r\nIn this instance:\r\n\"\tThe application was not considered to comply with the provisions of the Development Plan and NPPF as submitted\r\n\"\tIt is noted that the applicant/agent did not engage in any pre-application discussions.\r\n\"\tThe applicant is advised to seek pre-application advice on any resubmission.\r\n"
  ],
